  "name": "GX Start Battle ~Get Eevee~",
  "category": "event",
  "description": {
    "text": "Events at Pokémon Centers, Pokémon Stores, Pokémon Card Stations and Pokémon Card Gym venues from 13 July 2018, for players bringing or buying one of the GX Starter Decks and playing with it. Players got a holofoil Eevee, 245/SM-P, with the Pokémon Card Gym logo. From 1 March 2019, the Family Pokémon Card Game & GX Start Battle ~Get Eevee~ events, through March to May, and the parent and child tournaments at Pokémon Card Gym venues on the weekends of 16 and 17, and 23 and 24 March 2019, gave a non-holofoil Eevee with no logo, 310/SM-P."
  },
